    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">London, New Year\u2019s Eve 1999. </h2>While everyone is getting ready to party the metropolitan police are working overtime. Detective Inspector Redfern finds herself at the scene of an emerging arms trade at the foot of a high-rise tower. Without the permission of her superiors or the support of backup, Redfern prepares to go kick off the millennium with a bang. <br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1265720/extras/1e33621f41a416f8f762edb83797e6fc.poster.avif?t=1631200195\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1265720/extras/1e33621f41a416f8f762edb83797e6fc.webm?t=1631200195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1265720/extras/1e33621f41a416f8f762edb83797e6fc.mp4?t=1631200195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>RICO London</strong> is a gang-busting, name-taking, explosive co-op shooter. Battle your way up the high-rise tower stacked with East End gangsters solo or with a partner. Crash through doors, dodge bullets and turn the weapons of the fallen into your personal arsenal. Do whatever it takes reach the top.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1265720/extras/3feb54293d1a08af07bc01deab03a6b8.poster.avif?t=1631200195\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1265720/extras/3feb54293d1a08af07bc01deab03a6b8.webm?t=1631200195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1265720/extras/3feb54293d1a08af07bc01deab03a6b8.mp4?t=1631200195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">High-rise, Higher Stakes</h2>Ascend the dangerous gang infested tower, taking on tougher goons as you advance. The higher you get the higher the stakes.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1265720/extras/326aad5ce47e797507a29801d1695050.poster.avif?t=1631200195\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1265720/extras/326aad5ce47e797507a29801d1695050.webm?t=1631200195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1265720/extras/326aad5ce47e797507a29801d1695050.mp4?t=1631200195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">High Calibre</h2>The three magazines of 9mm you brought with you were never going to get you past the first floor. Chop and change from your ever-expanding arsenal to suit the task at hand as you defeat enemies along the way.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1265720/extras/5d4fad75e3224255b309831063e4665b.poster.avif?t=1631200195\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1265720/extras/5d4fad75e3224255b309831063e4665b.webm?t=1631200195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1265720/extras/5d4fad75e3224255b309831063e4665b.mp4?t=1631200195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Perks Of the Job</h2>Customise your loadout with a series of performance enhancing perks and upgrades. Modify your skills as the night unfolds. <br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1265720/extras/e8bdd60c56208b83a2997c20f9ba3e0f.poster.avif?t=1631200195\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1265720/extras/e8bdd60c56208b83a2997c20f9ba3e0f.webm?t=1631200195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1265720/extras/e8bdd60c56208b83a2997c20f9ba3e0f.mp4?t=1631200195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Double Trouble </h2>It wouldn\u2019t be a buddy cop shooter without a partner by your side. Call in a co-op ride-along, either local or online.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1265720/extras/ab63e8f80c298a2eaf22b001e3a72370.poster.avif?t=1631200195\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1265720/extras/ab63e8f80c298a2eaf22b001e3a72370.webm?t=1631200195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1265720/extras/ab63e8f80c298a2eaf22b001e3a72370.mp4?t=1631200195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>It is all down to you (and your partner) to bring the whole lot of them down, in the only way you can\u2026 kicking doors and shooting bad guys!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features List</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>\tArcade style game play<br></li><li>\tPlay through various game modes \u2013 follow the story in Operation (Easy or Normal), or jump straight in to shoot bad guys in Daily play.<br></li><li>\tCompelling storyline with exhilarating gameplay to match it<br></li><li>\tBuddy cop co-op shooter, in local or online<br></li><li>\tDefeat different enemy types to collect new weapons and expand your arsenal<br></li><li>\tRescue civilian hostages and get them to safety<br></li><li>\tMany collectible items to locate<br></li><li>\tMoment-to-moment action packed gameplay <br></li><li>\tBattle your way through the towers many storeys. <br></li><li>\tWatch the chaos unravel in slow motion<br></li><li>\tCell shaded, graphic-novel art style</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">London, New Year\u2019s Eve 1999. </h2>While everyone is getting ready to party the metropolitan police are working overtime. Detective Inspector Redfern finds herself at the scene of an emerging arms trade at the foot of a high-rise tower. Without the permission of her superiors or the support of backup, Redfern prepares to go kick off the millennium with a bang. <br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1265720/extras/1e33621f41a416f8f762edb83797e6fc.poster.avif?t=1631200195\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1265720/extras/1e33621f41a416f8f762edb83797e6fc.webm?t=1631200195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1265720/extras/1e33621f41a416f8f762edb83797e6fc.mp4?t=1631200195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>RICO London</strong> is a gang-busting, name-taking, explosive co-op shooter. Battle your way up the high-rise tower stacked with East End gangsters solo or with a partner. Crash through doors, dodge bullets and turn the weapons of the fallen into your personal arsenal. Do whatever it takes reach the top.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1265720/extras/3feb54293d1a08af07bc01deab03a6b8.poster.avif?t=1631200195\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1265720/extras/3feb54293d1a08af07bc01deab03a6b8.webm?t=1631200195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1265720/extras/3feb54293d1a08af07bc01deab03a6b8.mp4?t=1631200195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">High-rise, Higher Stakes</h2>A