ce src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1265720/extras/e8bdd60c56208b83a2997c20f9ba3e0f.webm?t=1631200195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1265720/extras/e8bdd60c56208b83a2997c20f9ba3e0f.mp4?t=1631200195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Double Trouble </h2>It wouldn\u2019t be a buddy cop shooter without a partner by your side. Call in a co-op ride-along, either local or online.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1265720/extras/ab63e8f80c298a2eaf22b001e3a72370.poster.avif?t=1631200195\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1265720/extras/ab63e8f80c298a2eaf22b001e3a72370.webm?t=1631200195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1265720/extras/ab63e8f80c298a2eaf22b001e3a72370.mp4?t=1631200195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>It is all down to you (and your partner) to bring the whole lot of them down, in the only way you can\u2026 kicking doors and shooting bad guys!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features List</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>\tArcade style game play<br></li><li>\tPlay through various game modes \u2013 follow the story in Operation (Easy or Normal), or jump straight in to shoot bad guys in Daily play.<br></li><li>\tCompelling storyline with exhilarating gameplay to match it<br></li><li>\tBuddy cop co-op shooter, in local or online<br></li><li>\tDefeat different enemy types to collect new weapons and expand your arsenal<br></li><li>\tRescue civilian hostages and get them to safety<br></li><li>\tMany collectible items to locate<br></li><li>\tMoment-to-moment action packed gameplay <br></li><li>\tBattle your way through the towers many storeys. <br></li><li>\tWatch the chaos unravel in slow motion<br></li><li>\tCell shaded, graphic-novel art style</li></ul>",
